---

<Shop
  title="Nicotine Reduction Guide - Step-Down Schedule and Tips"
  description="A complete nicotine reduction guide with step-down schedule, timeline for how long nicotine stays in your body, and practical tips for managing cravings at every stage."
  canonical="/nicotine-reduction-guide"
  ogType="article"
  ogImage="/images/og/og-best-of.svg"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
