    <h2>Related Reading</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 24px; margin: 20px 0;">
      <li><a href="/blog/best-nicotine-pouches-for-quitting-smoking">Best Pouches for Quitting Smoking</a> — Strength matching and product recommendations</li>
