      <li><a href="/beginners">Beginner Mode</a> — Filtered product view for newcomers</li>
    </ul>

    <p style="background: hsl(var(--muted)); padding: 24px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 48px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));">
      <strong>About this guide:</strong> SnusFriends provides evidence-informed harm reduction guidance. This guide references NHS stop smoking resources and WHO tobacco cessation guidelines. Nicotine reduction should be done at your own pace. Consult your doctor if you have cardiovascular conditions, are pregnant, or experience severe withdrawal symptoms.
    </p>
  </article>
</Shop>
